stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uninitialised
    Uninitialised --> ParsingAndValidation : CLI Invoked

    ParsingAndValidation --> AbortedInvalidInput : Schema / FK / Range Error (CN-01..CN-06)
    AbortedInvalidInput --> [*] : Exit Code 2

    ParsingAndValidation --> RegistryReady : Valid ProblemRegistry & Sessions Built
    RegistryReady --> TimetableSynthesis : Build Conflict Graph & Order Courses (ALG-03..ALG-06)

    TimetableSynthesis --> SpatialHallAndSeatPacking : Courses Placed (Including Soft-Gap Fallbacks & Unscheduled Flags)
    SpatialHallAndSeatPacking --> InvigilationStaffing : Halls, Alternate Columns & Ground-Floor Row-1 Assigned (ALG-09..ALG-12)
    InvigilationStaffing --> InitialAudit : Hall Staff & Building Chiefs Assigned or Marked UNSTAFFED (ALG-13..ALG-14)

    InitialAudit --> AbortedIntegrityFailure : Hard Invariant Broken in ALG-18
    AbortedIntegrityFailure --> [*] : Exit Code 3

    InitialAudit --> InitialValidSchedule : Hard Rules Verified (Clean, Soft-Violation, Partial-Unscheduled, or Partial-Unstaffed)

    InitialValidSchedule --> IncrementalCommandLoop : Change Commands Present (FR-05)
    InitialValidSchedule --> ReportGeneration : No Change Commands

    IncrementalCommandLoop --> IncrementalCommandLoop : Command APPLIED (State v+1) or REJECTED (Rolled Back to v)
    IncrementalCommandLoop --> ReportGeneration : All Commands Processed

    ReportGeneration --> Completed : Emit Deterministic CSV / JSON / TXT Artefacts (ALG-20)
    Completed --> [*] : Exit Code 0
